      "message": "With https://review.openstack.org/#/c/523005/ and the changes in cli.py and the oslo.config deprecations I think nothing else uses this method so I don\u0027t think this warning is really needed.\n\nIf you think the warning here is important, it should identify the action that is causing the warning to be emitted (calling the method?) so that the user knows what to stop doing.",
